  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> <strong>Magical Resilience:</strong> Resistance to Necrotic, Psychic, Radiant or Thunder - the Necrotic effect is on; switch to the type you chose on the Effects tab. <strong>Magic Resistant:</strong> when you fail a save against a spell or magic item, the module offers to roll 1d6 and add it (only when it could turn the failure into a success). Proficiency Bonus times per Long Rest - the feat's uses.</p>",
